{title: 12 Bar Blues}
{meta: style Medium Swing}
{meta: chart_author gohar}
{meta: chart_license CC0-1.0}

# A twelve bar jazz blues in F, written for gohar: the IV in bar 2, the
# VI7 in bar 8, a II-V in bars 9 and 10, and a turnaround. The chromatic
# dominants of the turnaround, A♭7 and G♭7, are optional: the player's
# to add once advanced enough.
{start_of_grid shape="4x4"}
| F7 | Bb7 | F7 | F7 |
| Bb7 | Bb7 | F6 | D7 |
| Gm7 | C7 | F6 D7~(Ab7) | G7 C7~(Gb7) |.
{end_of_grid}
